    "body": "Update: I tried to implement the `when` clause as an `Option<Vec<State>>`. I added the `Serialize` and `Deserialize` traits to `State` and although the config schema can be generated, Starship fails to load the config with an error message that `when` is given as a string when it expects an enum.\r\n\r\nWhat I also attempted is to use the `serde_with` crate to serialize/deserialize `State` with the existing `Display` and `Serialize` implementations respectively using `DisplayFromStr`. However, this conflicts with the config schema generation where it cannot serialize `State` as `DisplayFromStr` does not implement `JsonSchema`...",
