    "body": "After trying around with `#[serde(remote = \"...\")]` and manually implementing the serialization logic for `JsonSchema`, I think the best way to implement the feature is to just add the traits for `serde` and `JsonSchema` directly to `starship_battery::State`. `serde_with` and `JsonSchema` don't seem to play along nicely so as far as I can tell you have to write the serialization logic twice to use them with _remote_ enums.\r\n\r\nI'll go ahead and open a MR in the other repo to add the `serde` and `JsonSchema` traits if that's okay.",
    "created_at": "2022-04-23T18:52:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-04-23T18:52:04Z",
